        <mxCell id="n_spec" value="Spec text (col. 8): the 65.1 µs interrupt updates the on-chip PWM with the next sine point; the /32 interval is 2.08 ms, when the cryocooler driving current 28 is sampled and the watchdog is pulsed (8 samples per 16.7 ms cycle)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
